ets pricing Democratic control near 90 percent.", "senate": "Democrats hold a moderate edge for Senate control, with multiple competitive races and markets around 64 to 65 percent for a Democratic majority.", "governor": "Democrats are clear favorites to hold or expand governorships, aided by the favorable national environment and several Republican-held seats in contention."}, "environment_adjustment": 0.0, "uncertainty_multiplier": 1.0}}